# Laraplate Specific (caveman)

- App is modular Laravel (`nwidart/laravel-modules`).
- Core is foundation, loaded first, reused by all.
- CMS/ERP/AI/MES build on Core contracts and services.

- Module rules:
  - Keep module self-contained.
  - Keep dependency explicit in `module.json`.
  - Respect load priority.
  - Do not duplicate shared Core logic.
  - Table names prefixed by lowercase module name

- Stack baseline:
  - Laravel 12, PHP 8.5+, Filament, Sanctum, Pest.
  - Queue for heavy async jobs.
  - Eloquent-first, API-ready, test-first mindset.

- Global ecosystem details in `laravel-boost.mdc`.

- Eloquent model traits (IDE / PHPStan):
  - Use `@phpstan-require-extends \Illuminate\Database\Eloquent\Model` on traits meant for Eloquent models.
  - Do not use `@mixin Model` on traits (duplicate API across traits, IDE conflicts).
  - Use `@mixin \Eloquent` and `@mixin IdeHelper{Model}` on concrete models (`ide-helper:models -MN` + `EloquentMixinModelHook`).
  - Intelephense does not chain mixins: `IdeHelper*` alone hides inherited Eloquent instance methods (`hasManyThrough`, etc.).
  - Add `@property` on the trait only for host-specific fields the trait reads (not the full Model API).
  - Factory/command traits that are not used on models must not declare `require-extends Model`.
